00:02:03.957 --> 00:02:04.958
Ya.

00:02:16.703 --> 00:02:18.538
Ini alamat, nama, dan stempel.

00:02:18.705 --> 00:02:19.706
Ya.

00:02:42.562 --> 00:02:45.798
Hei, bawakan stempelnya!

00:02:48.568 --> 00:02:51.070
Minako, stempel!

00:03:16.329 --> 00:03:25.672
